        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    initial_value = 120000\n    salvage_value = 10000\n    useful_life = 5\n    year = 3\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    depreciation_rate = 2 / useful_life\n    book_value = initial_value\n\n    for _ in range(1, year):\n        depreciation = book_value * depreciation_rate\n        book_value = max(book_value - depreciation, salvage_value)\n\n    depreciation_expense = min(\n        book_value * depreciation_rate,\n        book_value - salvage_value\n    )\n\n    answer = round(depreciation_expense)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
